 ... \",\"title\":\"https://collider.com/longest-running-sitcoms-ranked/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d127\"},\"ref\":\"d127\",\"snippet\":\" ... Sofia Vergara and Joe Manganiello in July would get messy. But there was one issue over which tears might be shed: Who would get custody of Bubbles?\\n\\nThe 10-year-old dog, a Chihuahua/Pomeranian mix, initially was supposed to be Vergara's pet. The \\\"Modern Family\\\" star ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.mercurynews.com/2023/12/08/celebrity-heartbreak-2023-the-15-most-shocking-messy-splits-of-the-year/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d128\"},\"ref\":\"d128\",\"snippet\":\" ... After her brother died, Colombian-born actress Sofia Vergara and her family moved to Miami in 1998. Vergara became a US citizen in 2014.\\n\\nIn a 2014 interview with Jimmy Kimmel, the \\\"Modern Family\\\" star revealed she completely nailed the test, even though it was a long time ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.businessinsider.com/celebrities-who-are-immigrants-2017-2\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d129\"},\"ref\":\"d129\",\"snippet\":\" ... Sofia Vergara\\n\\nNow famous for flashing her smile on the red carpet, Sofia Vergara studied dentistry in college in her native Columbia. \\\"But I didn't finish,\\\" the \\\"Modern Family\\\" star said in a 2016 talk-show appearance.\\n\\nWilliam McKinley\\n\\nPresident William McKinley is one of only two ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbsnews.com/pictures/50-super-successful-college-dropouts/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d130\"